      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i just had a bit of a mishap in the kitchen and spilled some hot tea on my arm. the skin is bright red and feels really hot and sensitive, like a minor burn. i dont want to use harsh chemicals or anything, so i was wondering if applying some high-quality tea tree oil would be a good way to naturally soothe the heat and make sure it doesn't get infected?",
